OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas starts in February for
OL,4,Afestive advert creators
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 37-year-old, from Wakefield, has
OL,7,Fevery reason to be sick of the sight of
OL,8,Ftinsel or holly - he is an executive
OL,9,Fcreative director at London-based
OL,10,FWonderhood Studios, which has produced
OL,11,Fretailer Waitrose's festive ads since
OL,12,F2025.
OL,14,FLast year, the supermarket's offering
OL,15,Fwas a four-minute film starring Keira
OL,16,FKnightley and Joe Wilkinson, shot in
OL,17,Fthe style of a romantic comedy.
